 and enthusiasm versus age and experience in the third of four elimination challenges. Chris and Carrie from NSW compete with Tania and Rod from country Vic.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-22\",\"runtime\":27},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Elimination Night 4\",\"overview\":\"In the last of the eliminations, two sets of sisters take sibling rivalry to a new level: twins Laura and Emily from Victoria versus Katrina and Amie from country New South Wales.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-23\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"The Key Challenge\",\"overview\":\"Four couples make it through the elimination. They think they're home free but Scotty has another surprise. The couples compete to determine their place in the order of the choice of property to renovate.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-24\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Moving in to The Block\",\"overview\":\"In a one-hour episode, Scott Cam introduces the couples to their new homes, four dilapidated properties in Melbourne's Richmond. For the first time they get an idea of just how much scary-crazy work lies ahead of them.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-27\",\"runtime\":51},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Shelley Craft Challenge #1\",\"overview\":\"Challenge master Shelley Craft puts the couples through another challenge that has them driving all over Melbourne searching for much-needed cash and a very big twist.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-28\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Day 10\",\"overview\":\"The couples are tired, the conditions are primitive, and they have to get their first room ready for the judges, who will arrive again in just a few days.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-29\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Scotty's Workshop Challenge #1\",\"overview\":\"This one-hour episode introduces Scotty's Workshop, a place where the couples will not only compete for the opportunity to win cash and bonuses but learn valuable skills from the master builder.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-30\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Scotty and Shelley's Progress Report #1\",\"overview\":\"Scott Cam and Shelley Craft review progress as the couples struggle to complete their first room. All are feeling the pressure.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-01\",\"runtime\":19},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Room Delivery Night #1\",\"overview\":\"Judges John McGrath and Neale Whitaker review the first completed rooms. The winning team wins an extra $5000 towards their already dwindling budget. It's a testing time with unexpected results.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-04\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Shelley Craft Challenge #2\",\"overview\":\"Shelley Craft gives the couples $100 to buy a piece of second-hand furniture.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-05\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Day 17\",\"overview\":\"The neighbours become suspicious when Josh chooses to recycle junk to make a bed.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-06\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Scotty's Workshop Challenge #2\",\"overview\":\"The couples let off some steam in Scotty's workshop distressing a brand-new piece of pine furniture. Beware - violence against furniture.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-07\",\"runtime\":38},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Scotty and Shelley's Progress Report #2\",\"overview\":\"Scotty takes Shelley on another tour of work so far while Katrina and Amie face bathroom disaster.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-08\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Room Delivery Night #2\",\"overview\":\"For their second rooms, the couples could only use second-hand everything. Now the judges hand in their verdict.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-11\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Shelley Craft Challenge #3\",\"overview\":\"It's water torture as challenge master Shelley Craft takes the couples well and truly out of their comfort zones with the pipeworks challenge.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-12\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Day 24\",\"overview\":\"Time is their nemesis as the couples struggle to complete another room. Meanwhile, site foreman Keith has stern words with someone who is cutting corners.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-13\",\"runtime\":38},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Scotty's Workshop Challenge #3 / Progress Report #3\",\"overview\":\"The contestants engage in some high-stakes art therapy to win themselves a tradie for the day.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-14\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"The Block Unlocked #1\",\"overview\":\"Share a personal insight into The Block transformation as the couples guide us through their completed rooms. Hosted by Shelley Craft.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-15\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Room Delivery Night #3\",\"overview\":\"The judges deliver the good news, and the bad, for the couples' third room, the all-important main bathroom and laundry.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-17\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Shelley Craft Challenge #4\",\"overview\":\"Shelley Craft has the couples hanging wallpaper in a challenge with a big cash prize, but also one very big twist.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-18\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Day 30\",\"overview\":\"One couple's agonising decision causes serious bad-blood that threatens to rock The Block.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-19\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Day 31\",\"overview\":\"With their toughest room delivery coming up, one contestant almost comes to blows with site foreman Keith.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-20\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"Scotty's Workshop Challenge #4 / Progress Report #4\",\"overview\":\"Scott Cam challenges the couples to raise money for the Salvos and some very unexpected visitors drop in to lend a helping hand.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-21\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"The Block Unlocked #2\",\"overview\":\"Catch up on all the drama of the week and learn the design secrets of each couple as they guide you through their completed rooms. Hosted by Shelley Craft.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-22\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":27,\"name\":\"Room Delivery Night #4\",\"overview\":\"Room reveal of the master bedroom and ensuites. The judges agree that one couple have delivered the best room in the history of The Block.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-24\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":28,\"name\":\"Shelley Craft Challenge #5\",\"overview\":\"Shelley Craft sets the couples a challenge to style a room for Belle Magazine. One couple suffer a family tragedy and have to call in reinforcements.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-25\",\"runtime\":38},{\"number\":29,\"name\":\"Day 37\",\"overview\":\"Chaos ensues as the couples try to coordinate tradesmen for their hallways and living rooms. Josh and Jenna cannot agree on the layout.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-26\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":30,\"name\":\"Day 38\",\"overview\":\"The hallway and living rooms ar